  "solution": "Với mọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>≠</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> luôn xác định nên liên tục tại đó.<br>Mặt khác ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Để hàm số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"p